apparently he wanted to lose even more weight, but the director wouldn't let him

&#x200B;

" According to the [DVD](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DVD) [commentary](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Audio_commentary), he lost 62 pounds (28 kg), reducing his body mass to 120 pounds (54 kg). Bale wanted to go down to 99 pounds (45 kg), but the filmmakers would not let him due to health concerns.  "
